      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹2.23 (vs ₹1.61 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹2.23 (up from ₹1.61 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹311.3m (up 14% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹20.4m (up 39% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 6.5% (up from 5.4% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 16% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 6% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
